{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game has absolutely no elements like a heartwarming story or charming characters.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Guide the poop to the toilet bowl!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/6f4873d99aa57ed26ada4e8333926858.poster.avif?t=1758081563\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/6f4873d99aa57ed26ada4e8333926858.webm?t=1758081563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/6f4873d99aa57ed26ada4e8333926858.mp4?t=1758081563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple yet Profound Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in this game is &quot;jump.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, with this single, simple action, you'll need to navigate over 150 diverse and challenging stages. A high-difficulty action game awaits you, where you'll repeatedly fail, learn from trial and error, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Unique Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, walls of spikes, ON/OFF switches...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, a variety of unique gimmicks will appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming the different gimmicks and traps on each stage requires quick reflexes and puzzle-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and a catchy, cool BGM create a stylish atmosphere for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/4837f322dada1a5aabff34cc29047b47.poster.avif?t=1758081563\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/4837f322dada1a5aabff34cc29047b47.webm?t=1758081563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/4837f322dada1a5aabff34cc29047b47.mp4?t=1758081563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, spin, and customize your own Unko!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the <strong>UN-COIN</strong> you collect in stages to spin a gacha machine for customization items for your Unko, or to unlock even more challenging stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with replay value, with tons of unique items to collect. Try to collect them all!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3101010?t=1758081563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3101010?t=1758081563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758081563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758081563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game has absolutely no elements like a heartwarming story or charming characters.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Guide the poop to the toilet bowl!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/6f4873d99aa57ed26ada4e8333926858.poster.avif?t=1758081563\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/6f4873d99aa57ed26ada4e8333926858.webm?t=1758081563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/6f4873d99aa57ed26ada4e8333926858.mp4?t=1758081563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple yet Profound Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in this game is &quot;jump.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, with this single, simple action, you'll need to navigate over 150 diverse and challenging stages. A high-difficulty action game awaits you, where you'll repeatedly fail, learn from trial and error, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Unique Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, walls of spikes, ON/OFF switches...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, a variety of unique gimmicks will appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming the different gimmicks and traps on each stage requires quick reflexes and puzzle-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and a catchy, cool BGM create a stylish atmosphere for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa